{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the median. Columns with an even number of values were getting the lower of the two middle values instead of their average. Odd-length columns were already correct, which is why only some columns looked wrong.\n\nThe bug was in `median` in `repo/stats.py`. Even-length lists now return `(s[mid - 1] + s[mid]) / 2`. `stats_summary` in `repo/rows.py` and `old_median` both call this function, so they get the fix too.\n\nBoth tests in `tests/visible/test_stats.py` now pass, and a quick check of `stats_summary` gives 2.5 for `[4, 1, 3, 2]` and 3 for `[5, 1, 3]`.\n\nEven-length medians now come back as floats (for example 2.5), so the report cells will show decimals in those spots.\n\nI didn't touch the unrelated TODOs in `rows.py` and `format.py`."}]},"session_id":"5090d755-dd33-4733-935e-71040cc60adc"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":35001,"duration_api_ms":35001,"is_error":false,"result":"I'll look through the workspace to find where medians are computed.The bug is in `median` in `repo/stats.py`: for even-length columns it returns the lower middle value instead of averaging the two middle values. Fixing it.I fixed the median. Columns with an even number of values were getting the lower of the two middle values instead of their average. Odd-length columns were already correct, which is why only some columns looked wrong.\n\nThe bug was in `median` in `repo/stats.py`. Even-length lists now return `(s[mid - 1] + s[mid]) / 2`. `stats_summary` in `repo/rows.py` and `old_median` both call this function, so they get the fix too.\n\nBoth tests in `tests/visible/test_stats.py` now pass, and a quick check of `stats_summary` gives 2.5 for `[4, 1, 3, 2]` and 3 for `[5, 1, 3]`.\n\nEven-length medians now come back as floats (for example 2.5), so the report cells will show decimals in those spots.\n\nI didn't touch the unrelated TODOs in `rows.py` and `format.py`.","session_id":"5090d755-dd33-4733-935e-71040cc60adc","request_id":"e5a3cf0f-cf4c-4095-b7f7-aacff50c9c27","usage":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":1501,"cacheReadTokens":84570,"cacheWriteTokens":17834}}
